## 0. Opening (required)

1. Read `docs/STATE.json`; note `active_change` and `next_action`.
2. Read the last 3 lines of `docs/_sessions/INDEX.md`.
3. `last_session` ≠ newest session file ⇒ rebuild STATE from logs first.
4. Follow §4; open exactly one document (or one change folder).

